<messaging:emailTemplate relatedToType="Account"    subject="PAST DUE: Account Team review required by {!relatedTo.Core_Account_Team_Audit_Due_Date__c}"    replyTo="intel.covered.accounts@intel.com">    <messaging:htmlEmailBody >        <html>            <body>                <p>Dear {!relatedTo.Owner.Name},</p>                                            <p>Your review of Team Members on the Accounts you own was due on                    <apex:outputText value="{0, date, MMMM d, yyyy}">                        <apex:param value="{!relatedto.Core_Account_Team_Audit_Due_Date__c}" />                    </apex:outputText>                </p>                                <p><apex:outputlink value="{!LEFT($Api.Partner_Server_URL_140,FIND('.com',$Api.Partner_Server_URL_140)+4)+'apex/Core_AccountTeamAudit'}">                    Visit this page to review your Accounts' Team Members.                    </apex:outputlink>                </p>                                <p>As the Owner of one or more Accounts, Internal Audit requires that you review Account Team Members and their access levels on Accounts, Opportunities and Cases. This provides assurance that access has been limited to the Team Members who are working on an Account.</p>                                <p>It is important that you remove Team Members who are no longer working on Accounts you own.</p>                                <p>For Team Members who belong on the Account Team, you should set the Account, Opportunity and Case access level (Private, Read, or Read/Write) to the appropriate "need to know" level. Note that AccountRead/Write access grants Team Members the ability to edit Contact information and to emulate customers who are IPS Active Contacts. In addition, it provides edit access to non-core Account fields.</p>                <p>Please visit the linked page containing all the Accounts and Team Members that currently require your review. For each account, when your review and updates are complete, mark the Review Completed box, and make sure to save your change.</p>                              <p>This review must be completed by                     <apex:outputText value="{0, date, MMMM d'.'}">                        <apex:param value="{!relatedto.Core_Account_Team_Audit_Due_Date__c}" />                    </apex:outputText>                </p>                <p>For questions or further information, please contact your geo's Data Ops team.</p>                <p>Thank you!</p>            </body>        </html>    </messaging:htmlEmailBody></messaging:emailTemplate>